							Every guild does have it&#039;s people that are more prone to messing up.&nbsp; However...<br /><br />&quot;2.&nbsp; &nbsp;Listen and follow instructions.&quot;<br /><br />Regardless of how he remembers doing FR, it&#039;s inexcusable not to do the above.<br /><br />If you had a guest from another guild on your raid doing the above, would you actually let it continue?&nbsp; Not a chance in hell.&nbsp; At best I&#039;d make him sit in a corner.&nbsp; At worst I&#039;d have him kicked out.<br /><br />If it was an EiE member messing up like that I&#039;d have no problem calling him an idiot.
