	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8117"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=567" title="View the profile of Mabbu">Mabbu</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 3<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=567"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8117#msg8117"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8117#msg8117">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #25 on:</b> May 28, 2004, 08:30:52 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Perhaps he was never in the actual chat?&nbsp; Over the past couple months Ive been on several raids with other guilds doing PoP with them!&nbsp; And out of all of those times I was only invited into their actual chat maybe once!&nbsp; It&#039;s true I&#039;ve seen those encounters many times in the past and since I&#039;m a rogue I really didn&#039;t need to be in them!&nbsp; I&#039;m not trying to sound high and mighty but there isn&#039;t much wizards or rogues would gain or lose from not being in the channel!&nbsp; We just assist and do our damage normally!&nbsp; If I don&#039;t get a tell back after I&#039;ve asked what the chat channel is, I don&#039;t press the effort and most times I just stay out of the channel.<br /><br />I can see how encounters might be different these days with all the collision, and mobs being stuck in the walls, so sending pets in could be harmful today where we never had to deal with that crap in the past.&nbsp; Might have just been a habit of the past to send them in. <br /> <br />And with a wizard evacing the group out Heaven knows us Ascent rogues never go running around and get killed when we forget to hit hide and sneak or accidentally hit the wrong button when hidden.&nbsp; Hell no we blame it on SOS being broken!<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
